window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>From <i>New York Times</i> and <i>USA Today</i> bestselling author Kylie Scott comes a new story in her Stage Dive series...</p> <p>It all started in Vegas...</p> <p>After a wild and tumultuous beginning to their relationship, Evelyn Thomas and her rock star husband David Ferris have been happily married for years. Nothing needs to change, their life together is perfect. Which means that change in the shape of an unexpected pregnancy is bound to shake things up some. But could it be for the better?</p> <p>**Every 1001 Dark Nights novella is a standalone story. For new listeners, it’s an introduction to an author’s world. And for fans, it’s a bonus book in the author’s series. We hope you'll enjoy each one as much as we do.**</p>"; 
